1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,390
This is the Dermalogica Invisible Physical Defense SPF30.

2
00:00:04,390 --> 00:00:09,776
It's a physical sunscreen in a fifty milliliter tube, and the only sunscreen

3
00:00:09,776 --> 00:00:13,036
ingredient it features is non-nano zinc oxide.

4
00:00:13,807 --> 00:00:15,670
The big thing here is the finish.

5
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:19,226
It blends in without leaving a thick white residue on the skin.

6
00:00:19,926 --> 00:00:23,745
It helps defend your skin against UVA, UVB and blue light.

7
00:00:24,445 --> 00:00:28,358
It's suitable for all skin types, and that includes sensitive skin.

8
00:00:28,358 --> 00:00:30,461
You only need to apply it liberally.

9
00:00:31,161 --> 00:00:36,142
To use it, apply it liberally to your face, ideally thirty minutes before you go out

10
00:00:36,142 --> 00:00:36,794
in the sun.

11
00:00:36,794 --> 00:00:38,633
The link is in the description.
